  "development_scope": "Iteration 08 closes the two I07 release-blocking defects (provenance origin order, quiet/impersonate/disabled prompt re-injection) and implements the remaining proposal items: explicit role-private setting schema + actor-filtered retrieval, condition/exception-aware chunking, baseline write-gate calibration samples and entity-disjoint guard, same-name entity disambiguation, failed-refresh reuse of the active vector profile, scene evidence expansion, depth null/blank normalization, third-party quiet policy and dead baseline-hint removal. Commit H real SillyTavern acceptance is next."
